{"id":"600896e1acca6ba7","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-admissible-closure.md","title":"可容许集合的基本闭包","display":"thm-admissible-closure — 可容许集合的基本闭包","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-admissible-closure","aliases":["18-thm-admissible-closure"],"display":"thm-admissible-closure — 可容许集合的基本闭包","depends_on":["[[./18-df-admissible-set]]"],"source_title":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_edition":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5","source_section":"Lemma 11.4.1","source_printed_pages":"248–249","source_pdf_pages":"257–258","source_correspondence":"explicit-local-expansion","verification_status":"source-proof-checked","source_statement_status":"checked-2026-10-13","source_proof_review":"所引 Lemma 11.4.1 的证明已逐项核对；未覆盖后续序数分析","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-admissible-closure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-admissible-closure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-admissible-closure — 可容许集合的基本闭包"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d93cc27ebf4fb0d3\" href=\"?note=d93cc27ebf4fb0d3\" title=\"./18-df-admissible-set\">18-df-admissible-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_title","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Springer, 2009; ISBN 978-3-540-69318-5"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemma 11.4.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"248–249"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"257–258"},{"key":"source_correspondence","html":"explicit-local-expansion"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-proof-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-2026-10-13"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"所引 Lemma 11.4.1 的证明已逐项核对；未覆盖后续序数分析"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d93cc27ebf4fb0d3\" href=\"?note=d93cc27ebf4fb0d3\" title=\"./18-df-admissible-set\">18-df-admissible-set</a> 意义下的可容许集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c\\in A\">\\(a,b,c\\in A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(c\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>使用集合论元语言的配对、并、交和 Cartesian 积；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\">\\(\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}\\)</span> 为 Kuratowski 有序对。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\{a,b\\}\\in A\\ \\land\\ \\langle a,b\\rangle\\in A\\ \\land\\\n\\bigcup a\\in A\\ \\land\\ a\\cup b\\in A\\ \\land\\ a\\cap b\\in A\\ \\land\\\na\\times b\\in A\\ \\land\\ \\bigcap c\\in A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\{a,b\\}\\in A\\ \\land\\ \\langle a,b\\rangle\\in A\\ \\land\\\n\\bigcup a\\in A\\ \\land\\ a\\cup b\\in A\\ \\land\\ a\\cap b\\in A\\ \\land\\\na\\times b\\in A\\ \\land\\ \\bigcap c\\in A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已逐项核对 Lemma 11.4.1 的证明（PDF257–258）。由 (Pair') 找到含 a、b 的上界，再以 Δ₀ 分离取得 {a,b}；由 (Union') 的上界与 Δ₀ 分离取得 ⋃a。连续配对得到 Kuratowski 对，故二元并与交也存在。对非空 c，⋂c 是 ⋃c 中满足所有 y∈c 都含该元素的有界分离子集。</p>\n<p>Cartesian 积不能靠幂集公理取得：对固定 x∈a 先用 Δ₀ 收集获得覆盖所有 ⟨x,y⟩（y∈b）的集合，再对 x∈a 作一次 Δ₀ 收集，取该集合族的并并分离，得到 a×b。序对编码的检验均可写成有界公式。各步骤在内部结构中实施；A 的传递性保证所得配对、并与有界性质和外部集合论一致。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(c\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 是交集步骤的必要前提，未藏在证明里。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"./18-df-admissible-set","status":"resolved","id":"d93cc27ebf4fb0d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./18-df-admissible-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"./18-df-admissible-set","status":"resolved","id":"d93cc27ebf4fb0d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 是 [[./18-df-admissible-set]] 意义下的可容许集合，$a,b,c\\in A$，$c\\ne\\varnothing$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"a,b,c\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"c\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle a,b\\rangle=\\{\\{a\\},\\{a,b\\}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{a,b\\}\\in A\\ \\land\\ \\langle a,b\\rangle\\in A\\ \\land\\\n\\bigcup a\\in A\\ \\land\\ a\\cup b\\in A\\ \\land\\ a\\cap b\\in A\\ \\land\\\na\\times b\\in A\\ \\land\\ \\bigcap c\\in A.","display":true},{"tex":"c\\ne\\varnothing","display":false}],"bytes":2080,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-131","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-admissible-closure]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-117","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-admissible-closure]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-admissible-closure|18-thm-admissible-closure]]"}],"outgoing":["d93cc27ebf4fb0d3"]}